# textdomain: doggiowars
# Malay translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=Pertempuran udara di atas pulau voksel terapung — ANDA ialah jet pejuang. 12 biom pulau, gunung berapi dan air terjun, aksi aerobatik, rupa bumi boleh musnah dan perlumbaan anjing greyhound mengejar arnab emas. Papan kekunci + pad permainan.
